---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SubpageHeader from '../components/SubpageHeader.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us - BoxBattle (Dots and Boxes Game)"
  description="Discover the story behind BoxBattle, our modern recreation of the timeless Dots and Boxes paper-and-pencil game. Learn about our mission, AI engines, and history."
  url="https://dotsandboxesgame.com/about"
>
  <div class="subpage-wrapper">
    <SubpageHeader activePage="about" />

    <main class="content-container">
      <div class="about-card glass-panel">
        <header class="page-header">
          <div class="badge">About BoxBattle</div>
          <h1 class="page-title">Rediscovering Classic Strategy for the Modern Web</h1>
          <p class="subtitle">
            BoxBattle is a fast, responsive, privacy-conscious digital recreation of the beloved pencil-and-paper game <strong>Dots and Boxes</strong>.
          </p>
        </header>

        <!-- Our Mission -->
        <section class="story-section">
          <h2>🎯 Our Mission</h2>
          <p>
            For generations, <strong>Dots and Boxes</strong> has been played on scrap paper in classrooms, during road trips, and at kitchen tables. It is a deceptively simple game: draw lines, complete 1x1 squares, and claim boxes. Yet beneath its simplicity lies a rich combinatorial puzzle of strategy, sacrifice, and chain calculation.
          </p>
          <p>
            Our mission with <strong>BoxBattle</strong> is to bring this classic game into the 21st century:
          </p>
          <div class="features-grid">
            <div class="feature-item">
              <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
              <h3>Zero Friction</h3>
              <p>No paywalls, no invasive app installs, and no forced logins. Jump straight into the action with one click.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-item">
              <div class="feature-icon">🤖</div>
              <h3>Smart AI Engine</h3>
              <p>Three calibrated difficulty levels (Easy, Medium, and Hard) utilizing combinatorial chain-avoidance algorithms.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-item">
              <div class="feature-icon">👥</div>
              <h3>2-Player Couch Battle</h3>
              <p>Enjoy local pass-and-play multiplayer on any laptop, tablet, or mobile phone.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-item">
              <div class="feature-icon">🔒</div>
              <h3>Privacy Guaranteed</h3>
              <p>We respect your device. Your game records and preferences stay private in your local browser storage.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- History of the Game -->
        <section class="story-section">
          <h2>📜 The History of Dots and Boxes</h2>
          <p>
            The game was first published in 1889 by French mathematician <strong>Édouard Lucas</strong> under the French title <em>La Pipopipette</em>. Lucas, also renowned for his work on the Fibonacci sequence and the Tower of Hanoi, created the game as a mathematical diversion.
          </p>
          <p>
            In the 1970s and 1980s, game theory pioneers like <strong>Elwyn Berlekamp</strong> analyzed the game in depth in classic works such as <em>Winning Ways for Your Mathematical Plays</em> and <em>The Dots and Boxes Game: Sophisticated Child's Play</em>. Their research revealed that the endgame of Dots and Boxes turns on nuanced parity theorems, chain sacrifices, and double-cross strategies.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- How We Built It -->
        <section class="story-section">
          <h2>🛠️ How BoxBattle is Built</h2>
          <p>
            BoxBattle is engineered for instant performance, buttery-smooth animations, and accessible web standards:
          </p>
          <ul class="tech-list">
            <li><strong>Vector Precision:</strong> High-DPI interactive SVG board rendering with reactive touch and mouse targeting.</li>
            <li><strong>Web Audio Synthesizer:</strong> Procedurally synthesized sound effects for clicks, box completions, and victory fanfares without bulky audio downloads.</li>
            <li><strong>Dynamic Difficulty Engine:</strong> Algorithmic AI opponent capable of detecting 3-sided traps and calculating chain sweeps.</li>
            <li><strong>Cross-Platform Responsiveness:</strong> Tailored viewport scaling that feels natural on phones, tablets, and ultrawide desktop monitors.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Get In Touch CTA -->
        <div class="cta-banner">
          <h3>Have Questions or Suggestions?</h3>
          <p>We are constantly improving BoxBattle with new features and game modes. We’d love to hear your thoughts!</p>
          <div class="cta-buttons">
            <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">Play BoxBattle Now</a>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn">Get in Touch</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .subpage-wrapper {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .content-container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 900px;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem 4rem 1.5rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .about-card {
    padding: 3rem 2.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }

  .page-header {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: var(--player1-color);
    background: var(--player1-bg);
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #ffffff;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .subtitle strong {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .story-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .story-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .story-section p {
    font-size: 0.975rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .story-section strong {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .feature-item {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .feature-icon {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
  }

  .feature-item h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .feature-item p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .tech-list {
    margin-left: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .tech-list li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .tech-list strong {
    color: var(--player1-color);
  }

  .cta-banner {
    background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.7);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .cta-banner h3 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .cta-banner p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    max-width: 500px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .cta-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about-card {
      padding: 1.75rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .page-title {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }

    .features-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .cta-buttons {
      width: 100%;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
